# {{SYSTEM_NAME}} package rules

`{{PACKAGE_NAME}}` is an independent V4 design system. Keep its visual language
inside `tokens.source.json`, `src/styles`, and `src/components`; consuming apps should
compose the components rather than replace their appearance.

